[PrintTextModified Text:ズバン！|#0204Adv01_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,ArmL4,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:ぐぅっ！|#0204Adv01_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:――手を組んだ瞬間、<br>あっさりとアリサはひっくり返されていた。|#0204Adv01_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1,ArmR8

